From: ADP Codex Unchained
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] core: preserve function-call tool_search wire dialect

Some Responses-compatible providers expose Codex's client-side tool_search
surface as an ordinary function call rather than the specialized
tool_search_call item.

Preserve that dialect end-to-end:
- native tool_search_call -> ToolSearch payload -> tool_search_output
- ordinary function_call("tool_search") -> Function payload -> function_call_output

This lets host-side deferred tool discovery work with compatible providers
without converting their response/output dialect into an OpenAI-specific form.

